    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστεῖος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to the bravest,
				bestowed as the prize of valour,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέφανοι, τιμαί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				6.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέρας</span>”
