					Plu.
					<u>Thes.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡρακλεῖ ποιήσειν θυσίαν ἀριστεῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pyrrh.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			.</div>
